Following the [[Upheaval]], Gerudo Town was covered by a [[Sand Shroud]] that made it almost impossible for anyone to navigate the [[Gerudo Desert]], and soon came under attack by a horde of [[Gibdo]]s that could not be harmed by the soldiers' Weapons. The majority of Gerudo Town's inhabitants took refuge in an underground shelter until the situation can be resolved, while Gerudo Town itself is nearly deserted and occupied by Gibdos. Link no longer needs Gerudo clothing to enter.

