==Trivia==
* In {{BotW}} and {{TotK}}, many of the facilities in Gerudo Town were inspired by Japanese bridal training.<ref name="CaC 316"/>
* Despite being a place where only females are allowed, two male [[Goron]]s are shown to be in the city in {{BotW|-}}. One of them, [[Lyndae]], questions why they were allowed in.{{Fact}}
* In {{BotW}}, many of the visitors state they have trouble speaking the Gerudo language, which has lots of "v"s in it. This is something that is lost in translation as unlike many other languages Japanese does not have a "v" sound, and Japanese speakers normally emulate it with "b"s.

